{"id": null, "n": "0272001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272001", "type": "orig", "text": "諸佛已下八字檗本闕之乙本以朱加之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272002", "type": "orig", "text": "􄙖字乙本以朱加之"}
